          "message": {
            "text": "ceasn:isPartOf = https://credentialengineregistry.org/resources/ce-82566cee-17f3-4a6e-8f59-b45273aac457 on https://credentialengineregistry.org/resources/ce-9e492574-07fc-4154-b7f2-898425f4f3a3. This competency's isPartOf identifier matches no CompetencyFramework in this payload, although this run can see one (https://credentialengineregistry.org/resources/ce-177f4c85-4efe-401d-acdd-1ea4adeeaf37). If this competency belongs to that framework, this identifier is the wrong one.\n\nRule: ceasn:isPartOf is defined as \"Competency framework that this competency is a part of\" (CTDL-ASN schema), and the CTDL Handbook states: \"In the Registry, Competency Frameworks and their member Competencies are published in the same JSON-LD Graph\". A member competency whose isPartOf identifier matches no framework in its own payload very likely carries the wrong identifier.\nSource: https://credreg.net/ctdl/handbook (retrieved 2026-08-06)"
          },
